                </common:classification>
            </classificationInformation>
            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The raw materials for ready mix product are mixed. After mixing it is internally transported to the packing installation and packed. For the use 0.048 kg water has to be added per kg dry product (not included in this dataset). No direct process emissions are taken into account as they play a subordinate role compared to the emissions of the raw material production (e.g. drying of silica sand) and because no data is available. For inventorying the infrastructure, a yearly production amount of 150'000 tons is assumed. The lifespan of the machines is assumed to be 20 years.;
Synonyms: Anhydritestrich, Caclumsulfat-Fliessestrich; 
UUID: b2b0d494-9701-371b-a77d-2a26a7a2ae08</common:generalComment>
